WEBVTT

00:03.191 --> 00:05.191
[BARRIUS]
So, just kick them out?

00:05.271 --> 00:06.361
[MAN] Yeah.

00:07.071 --> 00:08.991
Trimming the excess fat is key.

00:09.071 --> 00:11.701
I've heard lots of guilds
are doing that lately.

00:12.321 --> 00:13.951
Maybe we should follow suit.

00:14.031 --> 00:15.201
[MAN] Trust me,

00:15.621 --> 00:18.251
the Beast's Fangs would
only benefit from some firings.

00:19.081 --> 00:21.671
Kicking people out
is great for business.

00:21.751 --> 00:24.881
Expenses go way down.
And the best part is

00:24.961 --> 00:27.131
you don't have to look
at their stupid faces

00:27.211 --> 00:28.921
every day you go to work.

00:31.181 --> 00:32.261
[Barrius grunts]

00:32.341 --> 00:35.601
You sold me on it!
Let's cut someone!

00:35.681 --> 00:39.021
Sounds like fun.
The only question is, who?

00:46.361 --> 00:47.691
♪

00:53.361 --> 00:54.451
[guild member 1 grunts]

00:54.531 --> 00:56.161
After that,
I definitely need a drink.

00:56.241 --> 00:57.661
That's another successful

00:57.741 --> 00:59.501
monster-slaying quest
in the books.

00:59.581 --> 01:02.831
Don't tell me you numbskulls
are already done with the job.

01:02.921 --> 01:04.671
[GUILD MEMBER 1] All we found
were weaklings.

01:04.751 --> 01:05.961
[laughter]

01:06.341 --> 01:08.841
[REIN] They're so lucky.
Getting the chance to fight.

01:08.921 --> 01:10.011
[indistinct chatter]

01:10.421 --> 01:12.801
[REIN] Me? I've never even
had the opportunity.

01:12.881 --> 01:15.101
My role is Enchanter.

01:15.181 --> 01:16.761
As long as I've been
with the guild,

01:16.851 --> 01:18.061
I've focused on enhancing

01:18.141 --> 01:20.311
everyone else's weapons
and equipment.

01:20.391 --> 01:21.481
[GUILD MEMBER] Uh?

01:21.561 --> 01:23.851
Move it, Rein.
Quit your daydreaming

01:23.941 --> 01:25.861
and get back
to what we pay you for.

01:25.941 --> 01:27.941
Right! Sorry about that.

01:30.441 --> 01:33.491
Oh, not bad. Not bad at all.

01:33.571 --> 01:35.411
With your fancy enchantments,

01:35.491 --> 01:37.951
even a normal sword
can be a legendary blade.

01:38.041 --> 01:39.411
I know.

01:39.491 --> 01:42.161
[smirks] I almost forgot.

01:42.251 --> 01:44.621
Follow me.
Guildmaster Barrius said

01:44.711 --> 01:46.921
he wanted to have
a word with you. Let's go.

01:47.791 --> 01:49.251
He wants to see me?

01:50.001 --> 01:51.131
♪

01:53.431 --> 01:55.181
[REIN] That shield...
That sword...

01:56.971 --> 01:59.511
His armor and his axe.

01:59.601 --> 02:02.731
Yours truly enchanted
each and every one.

02:02.811 --> 02:05.651
I may not go into battle,
but in my own way

02:05.731 --> 02:07.941
I contribute
to the guild's achievements.

02:08.481 --> 02:11.191
Now Barrius has personally
asked for me.

02:11.281 --> 02:12.861
I wonder what this is about.

02:12.941 --> 02:14.821
Maybe I'm getting a raise.

02:14.901 --> 02:17.411
Wait, what if
a famous adventurer

02:17.491 --> 02:19.371
heard about my skills
and traveled from far away

02:19.451 --> 02:21.201
to see if I would
enchant equipment for them?

02:21.291 --> 02:22.371
That's gotta be it.

02:22.451 --> 02:24.161
-You're fired, kid.
-[Rein gasps]

02:24.251 --> 02:27.211
With all the powerful weapons
and armor we've got now,

02:27.291 --> 02:29.211
there isn't any point
in keeping you around.

02:29.291 --> 02:32.301
Besides, the only actual skill
you've got is enchanting items,

02:32.381 --> 02:34.171
and what this guild
really needs are fighters.

02:34.261 --> 02:35.631
You can't just let me go

02:35.721 --> 02:38.141
if the pretext makes
literally zero sense.

02:38.221 --> 02:39.141
♪

02:39.221 --> 02:40.351
Still fired.

02:40.431 --> 02:42.061
Come on, you heard the man.

02:42.141 --> 02:43.311
Now, are you gonna
leave willingly,

02:43.391 --> 02:44.601
or do I have to make you?

02:44.681 --> 02:46.651
I still haven't accepted
this dumb decision.

02:46.731 --> 02:48.521
That's not our problem, runt.

02:48.611 --> 02:50.401
You wanna go? Bring it on!

02:51.151 --> 02:52.231
[grunts]

02:52.651 --> 02:55.611
Ouch. Yeah, I'm lacking
in battle experience,

02:55.701 --> 02:58.451
but that doesn't mean
I can't become an adventurer.

02:58.531 --> 03:00.081
[GUILD MEMBER 1] Shut up, Rein!

03:00.161 --> 03:02.661
[GUILD MEMBER 2] Yeah,
you'll never be one of us!

03:02.741 --> 03:05.501
[GUILD MEMBER 3] Who would
ever want to adventure with you?

03:05.581 --> 03:07.501
[GUILD MEMBER 4]
All you can do is enchant.

03:07.581 --> 03:09.791
You're just a weak,
useless, one-trick pony!

03:09.881 --> 03:10.881
We don't need you

03:11.211 --> 03:12.881
now that our gear's
already been enchanted.

03:12.961 --> 03:14.841
What made you think
that you weren't getting cut?

03:14.921 --> 03:16.801
[GUILD MEMBER 5]
You just gonna stand there?

03:16.881 --> 03:19.051
[GUILD MEMBER 6]
Get out of here, loser.

03:19.141 --> 03:20.801
[indistinct shouting]

03:20.891 --> 03:21.931
Incompetent.

03:22.011 --> 03:23.271
[breathes uneasily]

03:23.351 --> 03:25.601
-Go die on the streets.
-[Rein whimpers]

03:25.681 --> 03:26.981
Get out of here.

03:27.391 --> 03:29.521
[REIN] I thought these guys
were my friends,

03:29.601 --> 03:31.811
but none of them are going
to argue my case?

03:31.901 --> 03:33.571
[all booing]

03:33.651 --> 03:35.861
Yeah, well,
I was going to quit anyway,

03:35.941 --> 03:38.201
'cause I've had
enough of this shitty guild.

03:38.281 --> 03:41.371
[wailing]

03:52.751 --> 03:54.501
[Rein continues wailing]

04:02.431 --> 04:03.721
[coughs]

04:03.801 --> 04:06.181
Wait, where am I? Uh?

04:06.271 --> 04:08.931
[chuckles]
What am I even saying?

04:09.021 --> 04:10.101
[chuckles]

04:10.561 --> 04:12.111
[sighs]

04:13.021 --> 04:16.151
I can't just stand here
feeling sorry for myself.

04:19.071 --> 04:20.911
If they're gonna do
whatever they want,

04:20.991 --> 04:22.241
then so will I.

04:23.581 --> 04:26.581
Those idiots don't even know
how my enchantments work.

04:26.661 --> 04:27.911
Basically,

04:28.001 --> 04:29.961
I enhance weapons and armor
by imbuing them

04:30.041 --> 04:32.631
with bonus points,
a special type of mana.

04:33.711 --> 04:34.881
But...

04:38.461 --> 04:40.801
I hereby reclaim those points
as my own.

04:40.881 --> 04:43.431
All enchantments I cast
for the 512 members

04:43.511 --> 04:45.891
of the Beast's Fangs guild
are dispelled!

04:48.391 --> 04:49.981
♪

05:30.981 --> 05:34.191
[REIN] I'm taking back
every last point I gave them.

05:38.981 --> 05:41.031
Oh, whoa!

05:42.241 --> 05:45.241
Seriously? That's how many
bonus points I contributed

05:45.321 --> 05:46.701
to the Beast's Fangs?

05:47.581 --> 05:49.491
I can't carry it around
like this.

05:49.581 --> 05:51.581
I've got to put them
into something.

05:52.501 --> 05:53.831
That's pretty much all
I've got on me.

05:54.921 --> 05:57.541
Okay, let's give it a go.

05:57.631 --> 05:58.841
♪

06:03.841 --> 06:06.261
Plus 10,000
into my copper sword,

06:06.341 --> 06:08.971
which leaves 3,033 points.

06:09.061 --> 06:11.101
I'm gonna be so OP.

06:11.181 --> 06:13.061
What should I put
the remainder into?

06:13.141 --> 06:16.101
Armor or a shield?
I don't have either.

06:16.191 --> 06:17.611
[laughing]

06:20.861 --> 06:21.941
There.

06:23.951 --> 06:24.901
♪

06:24.991 --> 06:27.621
Plain clothes plus 3,033.

06:27.701 --> 06:29.661
I'm willing to bet
they offer more protection

06:29.741 --> 06:31.121
than your standard armor!

06:31.751 --> 06:33.871
Offense and defense enhanced.

06:33.961 --> 06:35.371
Even though I lack experience,

06:35.461 --> 06:38.041
I should be able to hold my own
in a fight with these.

06:38.131 --> 06:39.671
[inhales deeply]

06:39.751 --> 06:40.921
♪

06:41.001 --> 06:43.131
I just realized
I've never taken a break

06:43.211 --> 06:45.051
from working until this moment.

06:45.131 --> 06:46.971
I always wanted to take it easy,

06:47.051 --> 06:49.511
maybe try my hand
at adventuring someday.

06:50.511 --> 06:51.561
Uh?

06:52.521 --> 06:54.351
I could do
both those things now.

06:54.431 --> 06:55.731
I'll join some other guild

06:55.811 --> 06:57.561
and earn money
adventuring for them.

06:57.651 --> 07:00.771
And best of all, I've got
the freedom to stay or go.

07:12.491 --> 07:15.541
[REIN] Excuse me, I'm looking
for an adventurer's guild.

07:15.621 --> 07:17.791
One besides
the Beast's Fangs, that is.

07:17.871 --> 07:19.961
[BAKER] Sir, this is a bakery.

07:20.041 --> 07:22.501
The least you could do
is purchase a croissant.

07:22.591 --> 07:24.671
Know what?
I will take one of those!

07:26.221 --> 07:27.801
Now, do you know of any guilds?

07:27.881 --> 07:30.551
Nope. Still don't.

07:30.641 --> 07:31.931
[CANDY MAKER]
You got a question,

07:32.011 --> 07:33.641
buy something from me first.

07:33.721 --> 07:35.681
[TOY MAKER] I'll tell you
if you purchase from my booth.

07:35.771 --> 07:37.561
[MASK MAKER] Try on a mask.

07:39.061 --> 07:40.561
No one's being very helpful.

07:42.021 --> 07:43.111
[THUG 1] Hey.

07:43.571 --> 07:44.571
[REIN] Huh?

07:45.361 --> 07:46.611
Who, me?

07:46.701 --> 07:48.281
Who else would we be talking to?

07:48.361 --> 07:50.701
Yeah, you see
anybody else around?

07:50.781 --> 07:51.951
[THUG 1] Your money.

07:52.031 --> 07:53.451
[THUG 2] Give it here.

07:53.531 --> 07:55.121
-[whimpering]
-Not like you have any gear

07:55.201 --> 07:56.291
worth stealing.

07:56.831 --> 08:00.001
[THUG 1] Wanna get slugged
in the stomach? Hand it over.

08:00.081 --> 08:01.921
-[REIN] Oh.
-[BOTH] Huh?

08:02.001 --> 08:04.961
[REIN] I just remembered
I'm wearing enhanced clothes.

08:05.051 --> 08:07.881
A punch to the gut probably
wouldn't me hurt at all.

08:07.971 --> 08:09.431
What a great chance

08:09.511 --> 08:12.851
to test the defense
of my plain clothes plus 3,033.

08:12.931 --> 08:14.641
-[GIRL] Hold it.
-Huh?

08:14.721 --> 08:18.101
Would you care to tell me
what you two think you're doing?

08:18.181 --> 08:19.271
[THUG 1] Huh?

08:19.351 --> 08:20.901
[THUG 2] Who the hell are you?

08:20.981 --> 08:22.731
I don't see how that makes
any difference

08:22.811 --> 08:25.481
when your vile behavior's
clearly the bigger issue here.

08:25.571 --> 08:27.741
What? We were just
having a little chat

08:27.821 --> 08:29.241
-with our new friend.
-Huh?

08:29.321 --> 08:31.781
Well, in any case,
I'm gonna call for some help.

08:31.871 --> 08:33.031
Huh...

08:33.121 --> 08:35.531
I didn't quite catch that,
you bitch.

08:35.621 --> 08:37.581
You said you wanna
get beat up first?

08:37.661 --> 08:38.791
[gulps]

08:39.371 --> 08:40.541
-[REIN] Wait.
-Uh?

08:40.621 --> 08:42.751
This is just between us, right?

08:42.831 --> 08:44.501
Thank you for trying to help,

08:44.591 --> 08:47.051
but I've got this covered,
so please step back.

08:47.711 --> 08:49.131
This might shock you,

08:49.221 --> 08:51.631
but I'm looking forward
to getting punched.

08:52.431 --> 08:53.761
[GIRL] What kind
of weird situation

08:53.851 --> 08:55.351
did I wander into?

08:55.431 --> 08:57.601
Uh? What are you, a simpleton?

08:57.681 --> 08:59.181
You do know
that's gonna hurt, right?

08:59.271 --> 09:00.561
Who even asked you?

09:01.021 --> 09:02.901
For your information, I want to
get punched as hard as possible.

09:02.981 --> 09:04.151
Sorry, you what?

09:04.231 --> 09:05.441
Are you a masochist?

09:05.521 --> 09:06.571
[continues indistinctly]

09:06.651 --> 09:08.281
You wanna get punched
in the stomach,

09:08.361 --> 09:10.111
you bad boy! Here you go!

09:10.741 --> 09:13.201
[both screaming]

09:13.281 --> 09:14.911
It doesn't hurt.

09:14.991 --> 09:16.081
My hand!

09:17.201 --> 09:18.791
He's made of steel!!

09:18.871 --> 09:21.751
-[thug cries]
-[all gasp]

09:21.831 --> 09:24.081
Don't look so shocked,
you knew this would happen!

09:24.171 --> 09:27.591
We're gonna make you pay
for this, brat, mark my words!

09:27.671 --> 09:30.801
-[thug 1 cries]
-You better watch your back.

09:33.131 --> 09:35.551
Snuck a metal plate under there,
didn't you?

09:35.641 --> 09:38.311
Actually, I spent
3,033 bonus points

09:38.391 --> 09:39.561
to enhance this outfit.

09:40.061 --> 09:43.231
Right, if I had a bonus point
for every time I heard that one.

09:43.311 --> 09:44.651
So are you an adventurer?

09:44.731 --> 09:47.271
Yeah! You can call me Rein.

09:47.361 --> 09:49.191
Nina. Hi!

09:50.031 --> 09:51.741
[REIN] By the way, do you know

09:51.821 --> 09:54.151
if there are any
adventurer's guilds around here?

09:54.241 --> 09:56.701
Oh, you're looking
for a guild to join?

09:56.781 --> 10:00.661
You... could join
the Blue Crystals. Well?

10:00.751 --> 10:02.161
I've never heard of them.

10:02.251 --> 10:03.831
Are you sure that
they're from around here?

10:03.911 --> 10:06.581
Yes, I'm sure. I happen
to be a receptionist for them.

10:06.671 --> 10:07.841
Thank you very much.

10:07.921 --> 10:09.131
[REIN] Oh.

10:09.961 --> 10:11.091
[NINA] If you'd like,

10:11.171 --> 10:12.591
I'd be happy
to show you the way.

10:12.671 --> 10:14.761
As a matter of fact,
I'm heading back there

10:14.841 --> 10:16.641
at this very moment.

10:16.721 --> 10:18.851
What luck! In that case,
lead the way.

10:18.931 --> 10:22.181
[Nina chuckles] Try not to act
too surprised, though.

10:22.271 --> 10:23.351
[REIN] By what?

10:23.431 --> 10:25.691
[NINA] Oh, you'll see
once we get there.

10:28.901 --> 10:30.151
♪

10:35.741 --> 10:37.321
Disappointing, huh?

10:37.411 --> 10:39.741
I guess you changed your mind
about joining us.

10:39.831 --> 10:41.951
Mm-mm. No way.

10:42.041 --> 10:44.371
I still want to register
as an adventurer here.

10:44.451 --> 10:46.791
-What? Are you sure?
-Yeah.

10:46.881 --> 10:49.341
This isn't some put on.
You seriously want to join?

10:49.421 --> 10:51.211
I just said so. Why would I lie?

10:51.301 --> 10:53.511
[NINA] Master!
I've got big news!

10:53.591 --> 10:57.091
Someone actually wants
to register with our guild!

10:57.181 --> 11:00.351
[guildmaster shouts]
What? No way!

11:01.221 --> 11:03.141
Are you sure
it's not a walk-in

11:03.221 --> 11:04.891
asking if this is
the Beast's Fangs,

11:04.981 --> 11:07.101
finding out it's not,
and saying, "see you"?

11:07.191 --> 11:08.981
That was funny
the first hundred times,

11:09.061 --> 11:11.481
but it's starting
to get old. Hmm?

11:11.571 --> 11:12.771
♪

11:12.861 --> 11:13.781
[yelps]

11:14.401 --> 11:16.491
[REIN] I want to join because
I left the Beast's Fangs.

11:16.571 --> 11:18.451
Are you taking new adventurers?

11:18.531 --> 11:19.821
[exclaims]

11:19.911 --> 11:23.491
Yes. I knew you were
a natural recruiter, Nina.

11:24.791 --> 11:27.661
Name's Elsie. Guildmaster
of the Blue Crystals,

11:27.751 --> 11:30.421
your brand-new home.
Nice to meet you.

11:30.501 --> 11:32.091
Put it there.

11:32.541 --> 11:33.671
[REIN] Hmm?

11:34.091 --> 11:35.211
[Rein exclaims]

11:35.761 --> 11:38.471
[ELSIE] Well, I'm off to do
guildmaster stuff in the back.

11:38.551 --> 11:41.221
If you need anything at all,
don't hesitate to ask.

11:41.301 --> 11:43.681
You know Elsie.
Morning, noon, and night.

11:43.771 --> 11:45.561
She's always happy
to lend an ear.

11:45.641 --> 11:47.851
Nina, you take care of the rest.

11:47.941 --> 11:49.351
Sure thing.

11:50.151 --> 11:51.651
And this form just explains

11:51.731 --> 11:53.731
the intermediary fees
and rewards.

11:53.821 --> 11:56.861
Go ahead and sign, and you'll be
registered with us.

11:56.941 --> 11:58.491
Sounds good.

11:58.571 --> 11:59.781
[gasps]

12:00.161 --> 12:02.871
So, this place is supposed to be
home of the Beast's Fangs?

12:02.951 --> 12:06.001
Course not! Look around!
This guild's a complete dump!

12:06.081 --> 12:07.121
Hold on!

12:07.871 --> 12:09.581
So here's the deal, sweetheart.

12:09.671 --> 12:12.091
Hand over your money
or we'll level this hellhole.

12:12.171 --> 12:13.791
What? Who are you?

12:13.881 --> 12:16.011
[THUG 1] We accepted a job here
the other day

12:16.091 --> 12:17.551
that really sucked.

12:17.631 --> 12:20.091
[THUG 2] We're prepared
to forgive you if you pay up.

12:20.181 --> 12:22.511
Yeah, or you can
hand over that guy

12:22.601 --> 12:24.011
and we'll call
the whole thing settled.

12:24.101 --> 12:25.681
-Yeah, let's do that!
-Uh?

12:25.771 --> 12:28.641
Good. Now step outside.

12:28.731 --> 12:29.941
Sure!

12:30.651 --> 12:32.481
[NINA] Where are you going?

12:32.561 --> 12:34.061
You can't go outside!

12:34.151 --> 12:36.361
Why not? It sounds like
they have business with me.

12:36.441 --> 12:38.071
I don't know
what you're expecting,

12:38.151 --> 12:40.491
but they're gonna do a lot worse
than just punch you!

12:40.571 --> 12:43.451
Relax, Nina.
I took on two guys earlier.

12:43.531 --> 12:44.991
I'm sure I can handle
these clowns.

12:45.081 --> 12:46.741
[both gasp]

12:46.831 --> 12:48.081
♪

12:50.871 --> 12:53.541
See, brat, we told you
we'd get you back!

12:53.631 --> 12:55.631
We heard about what you did
to our pal here!

12:55.711 --> 12:57.881
You think you can get away
with this crap, you punk?

12:57.961 --> 13:00.671
Step over here
and let's get this over with!

13:00.761 --> 13:02.261
Rein, run away

13:02.341 --> 13:04.431
or there's not gonna be
anything left of you.

13:04.511 --> 13:06.011
[REIN] Hey, don't worry.

13:06.101 --> 13:07.431
I actually expected

13:07.521 --> 13:08.931
that something like this
was gonna happen,

13:09.021 --> 13:10.931
so I prepared
the ultimate weapon.

13:12.941 --> 13:14.151
[trembles] That?

13:14.231 --> 13:15.901
Now I know you're insane.

13:15.981 --> 13:17.981
Come on, just listen to reason.

13:18.071 --> 13:19.401
You don't stand a chance
against them.

13:19.491 --> 13:21.241
I'll have you know
this blade's been enchanted

13:21.321 --> 13:22.991
with 10,000 bonus points.

13:23.071 --> 13:25.201
And besides, being little
doesn't automatically

13:25.281 --> 13:26.531
make you weak, trust me.

13:26.621 --> 13:28.291
[THUG 1] What do you plan
on doing to us

13:28.371 --> 13:29.831
with that toothpick?

13:30.251 --> 13:31.371
[exclaims]

13:31.461 --> 13:35.461
[REIN] Whoa!
Stop pulling on me, Nina!

13:35.541 --> 13:37.791
[thugs yelling]

13:39.591 --> 13:40.721
[thugs screaming]

13:44.091 --> 13:45.601
[both gasp]

13:45.681 --> 13:47.181
[rumbling]

13:58.071 --> 13:59.401
[THUG 1] What was that?

13:59.481 --> 14:01.031
[THUG 2] He isn't human!

14:01.111 --> 14:02.861
[THUG 3] He's a crazed monster!

14:02.941 --> 14:04.991
[THUG 4] Run away! Run away!

14:05.071 --> 14:06.451
♪

14:10.121 --> 14:11.251
[NINA] Uh, Rein...

14:11.331 --> 14:13.621
What did you just do?

14:13.711 --> 14:15.831
Nothing,
I just swung my sword a bit.

14:16.251 --> 14:18.251
Understatement of the year.

14:18.671 --> 14:19.921
[REIN] Oh...

14:20.001 --> 14:21.511
[exclaims]

14:22.471 --> 14:23.801
♪

14:27.261 --> 14:30.181
Thankfully, no bystanders
got caught in the blast.

14:30.261 --> 14:32.431
That's good. We got lucky.

14:32.521 --> 14:33.681
Yeah, no kidding!

14:33.771 --> 14:35.441
You're going to have
to be more careful.

14:35.521 --> 14:36.441
Can you do that, Rein?

14:36.521 --> 14:37.901
-[Rein yelps]
-Master!

14:38.481 --> 14:39.771
You've got it, Elsie!

14:39.861 --> 14:41.861
You're a member
of the Blue Crystals now,

14:41.941 --> 14:43.491
and we always look out
for one another.

14:43.571 --> 14:44.691
We've got veteran members

14:45.031 --> 14:46.821
that can teach you skills
you never knew existed.

14:46.911 --> 14:47.951
You'd be shocked

14:48.281 --> 14:50.081
by how long some of them
have been adventuring.

14:50.161 --> 14:52.581
Master's right.
I'm sure with some training

14:52.661 --> 14:54.701
you'll eventually be able
to control your powers.

14:54.791 --> 14:56.791
[exclaims] You really think so?

14:56.871 --> 14:57.921
-[ELSIE] Rein.
-Uh?

14:59.341 --> 15:01.591
Believe me,
someday, you're going to be

15:01.671 --> 15:02.921
-one of the greats.
-[Rein chuckles]

15:03.711 --> 15:06.511
Well, then,
welcome to the Blue Crystals!

15:08.011 --> 15:09.851
I just wanted to let you know

15:09.931 --> 15:11.971
the Blue Crystals covered
the street repairs

15:12.061 --> 15:15.061
and the buildings.
So now you owe us 1,000 gold.

15:15.141 --> 15:17.351
Wha-- 1,000?

15:18.441 --> 15:20.561
How many years'
earnings is that?

15:20.981 --> 15:23.611
Oh, man, your face.
Look, it's not a big deal.

15:23.691 --> 15:24.781
Since you're working for me,

15:24.861 --> 15:26.491
I'll just garnish it
from your wages.

15:26.571 --> 15:27.611
Problem solved.

15:27.701 --> 15:29.911
Hey! That makes
a whole lot of sense!

15:29.991 --> 15:31.161
How about it, Nina?

15:31.241 --> 15:33.791
You got any jobs
that pay a grand in gold?

15:33.871 --> 15:36.041
Um, we do have quests,

15:36.121 --> 15:38.211
but you need to have
some experience first.

15:38.291 --> 15:40.751
Come on, Nina,
don't be like that.

15:40.841 --> 15:42.421
What about that one job?

15:42.501 --> 15:44.711
Master, I really don't think

15:44.801 --> 15:47.131
Rein's ready
for that level of difficulty.

15:47.221 --> 15:48.721
What job are you talking about?

15:48.801 --> 15:51.141
[Nina groans]

15:52.931 --> 15:54.681
Dragon slaying.

15:55.141 --> 15:56.771
[dragon growls]

15:56.851 --> 15:57.931
[Rein gasps]

15:59.481 --> 16:02.191
[NINA] We received the request
nearly two weeks ago.

16:02.611 --> 16:04.771
The client has reached out
to other guilds,

16:04.861 --> 16:07.691
but everyone's busy,
so no one's accepted it yet.

16:07.781 --> 16:08.821
[REIN] I will.

16:08.901 --> 16:10.911
No offense,
but you're not ready.

16:10.991 --> 16:13.241
Even the most high-ranked
adventurers out there

16:13.331 --> 16:14.531
can't defeat a dragon.

16:14.621 --> 16:16.331
They wouldn't dream
of taking one on.

16:16.411 --> 16:17.951
Not without a few years
of experience

16:18.041 --> 16:19.121
under their belt.

16:19.541 --> 16:21.501
-And you--
-I say go for it.

16:21.581 --> 16:23.041
Follow your dreams, kid.

16:23.131 --> 16:25.671
Well, I've got
more guildmaster stuff to do.

16:25.761 --> 16:27.301
But Master...

16:27.381 --> 16:29.471
[REIN] The client's waiting
for a response, right?

16:29.551 --> 16:31.891
So, I volunteer, send me!

16:31.971 --> 16:33.391
[Nina stutters]

16:34.471 --> 16:36.471
He looks like
a part - time dog walker

16:36.561 --> 16:38.851
and is talking about
slaying a dragon?

16:38.931 --> 16:40.101
You were there.

16:40.191 --> 16:42.941
You saw what my equipment
is capable of.

16:43.731 --> 16:45.981
This sword has
10,000 bonus points,

16:46.071 --> 16:48.611
and my clothes have 3,033,

16:48.691 --> 16:50.821
making them stronger
than steel armor.

16:51.321 --> 16:53.371
Go ahead and try stabbing me
with a knife.

16:53.451 --> 16:55.081
Who in their right mind
would try and do that?

16:57.371 --> 16:58.581
[screams]

16:59.831 --> 17:00.791
[REIN] Huh?

17:01.621 --> 17:03.001
So it's true.

17:04.041 --> 17:06.381
Cloth that's stronger
than steel armor.

17:07.841 --> 17:11.591
You tried killing me
with a sword. [laughs]

17:11.681 --> 17:13.091
Did you see that, Nina?

17:13.181 --> 17:14.681
[NINA] I would have
reacted differently

17:14.761 --> 17:15.681
if I were him.

17:15.761 --> 17:17.511
So, who are you anyway?

17:18.681 --> 17:21.941
Not like it matters.
But I'm Lily Flambert.

17:22.561 --> 17:24.981
Really? I've heard of you.

17:25.691 --> 17:26.901
[LILY] If you're so hung-up

17:26.981 --> 17:29.151
about sending him off
by himself,

17:29.231 --> 17:30.281
I'll go along.

17:30.361 --> 17:31.951
[NINA] But Lily, don't you--

17:32.031 --> 17:34.781
[LILY] It's all right.
I'm going to be just fine.

17:34.871 --> 17:36.491
Come on, Nina,
have you forgotten

17:36.581 --> 17:38.291
that I'm an S-rank adventurer?

17:38.371 --> 17:39.621
[REIN] I'm D-rank!

17:39.911 --> 17:42.161
[LILY] Yeah, I wouldn't
go around bragging about that.

17:42.831 --> 17:44.881
Let's get moving. Rein, was it?

17:44.961 --> 17:46.211
[Rein exclaims] Yeah.

17:46.291 --> 17:48.751
Uh, before you go,
I need to confer

17:48.841 --> 17:50.051
-with the master.
-[door closes]

17:50.131 --> 17:52.421
Uh? Get back here!

17:52.511 --> 17:54.551
-[footsteps]
-[indistinct chatter]

18:07.861 --> 18:10.071
This city's changed
since I saw it last.

18:10.151 --> 18:11.111
♪

18:11.191 --> 18:13.651
[REIN]
Lily Flambert, a swordsman

18:13.741 --> 18:16.571
who became the youngest
S-rank adventurer ever.

18:18.121 --> 18:20.831
Her name is known
all across the continent.

18:21.831 --> 18:25.211
At age seven,
she slew five low-level dragons.

18:25.291 --> 18:27.341
-[dragon growls]
-[REIN] When she was only 12,

18:27.421 --> 18:29.501
she tamed and rode
a mid-level one.

18:30.751 --> 18:33.511
Eventually,
she became so powerful,

18:33.591 --> 18:35.471
she started defeating
high-level dragons

18:35.551 --> 18:37.301
without needing
anyone else's help.

18:38.051 --> 18:39.681
But these past few years,

18:39.761 --> 18:42.181
we haven't heard a peep
about her recent exploits.

18:42.271 --> 18:44.231
There were a bunch
of rumors going around

18:44.311 --> 18:46.401
about how you were
either crippled or dead,

18:46.481 --> 18:48.651
but you don't look crippled
or dead to me.

18:49.231 --> 18:52.691
I'm right here. You don't need
to tell me my life story.

18:52.781 --> 18:54.861
[REIN] Could you tell me
how an adventurer like you

18:54.941 --> 18:55.951
ended up with the Blue Crystals?

18:56.031 --> 18:57.201
[Lily grunts]

18:58.451 --> 18:59.451
Uh?

19:00.871 --> 19:02.451
They're as good
as any other guild.

19:02.541 --> 19:03.661
[chuckles]

19:04.291 --> 19:06.251
True, so very true.

19:06.671 --> 19:09.341
Thanks again, Lily.
I'm so glad you're here.

19:12.501 --> 19:14.301
[LILY] I don't deserve
your thanks.

19:15.011 --> 19:16.721
Imagine what it would do
to the guild

19:16.801 --> 19:18.301
if you wound up dying.

19:18.391 --> 19:19.551
[REIN] Uh?

19:20.811 --> 19:22.811
[LILY] The Blue Crystals
would never hear the end of it

19:22.891 --> 19:26.061
if they sent a total novice
to slay a dragon by himself.

19:26.521 --> 19:28.851
That's the only reason
I'm going with you.

19:29.481 --> 19:31.441
You know, I was so focused
on enchanting,

19:31.521 --> 19:33.981
I've never fought before.
This will be my first time

19:34.071 --> 19:35.941
besides those thugs
the other day.

19:36.031 --> 19:37.821
Oh, yeah, be sure to let me know

19:37.901 --> 19:39.821
if you need anything
of yours enchanted.

19:46.581 --> 19:48.211
That's a magic sword.

19:48.291 --> 19:50.881
That's right.
While it may be unsigned,

19:50.961 --> 19:53.631
this powerful blade was forged
using magic techniques.

19:53.711 --> 19:54.921
Shall I?

19:56.131 --> 19:57.051
-Lily?
-I don't need

19:57.591 --> 19:59.931
any of your enchantments,
rookie. Don't fall behind.

20:07.481 --> 20:10.101
[LILY] Definitely looks like
a mid-level dragon.

20:10.191 --> 20:12.061
A dragon? I don't see one.

20:12.151 --> 20:15.941
I didn't mean that it's here.
I can tell from the damage.

20:16.031 --> 20:17.691
Well, of course you can,

20:17.781 --> 20:19.861
'cause you're
a legitimate adventurer.

20:19.951 --> 20:22.031
[LILY] It comes from experience.

20:22.451 --> 20:24.491
You'll pick things up
while adventuring,

20:24.581 --> 20:25.911
whether you like it or not.

20:25.991 --> 20:27.831
[REIN] Come on, let's go.
[chuckles]

20:27.911 --> 20:29.581
Where are you going?

20:29.661 --> 20:31.461
To the dragon. Hurry, this way.

20:31.541 --> 20:34.341
If that's where we're headed,
it's this way.

20:34.421 --> 20:37.011
[exclaiming]
What a professional!

20:37.091 --> 20:38.511
Stop shouting about everything!

20:38.591 --> 20:40.181
But I'm in the presence
of greatness!

20:40.261 --> 20:41.591
What is your problem?

20:41.681 --> 20:43.721
[running footsteps]

20:55.821 --> 20:56.861
[LILY] Very soon.

20:58.401 --> 20:59.401
[REIN] Uh?

21:00.151 --> 21:02.161
[LILY] It could appear
at any time.

21:02.821 --> 21:04.241
[REIN] Uh...

21:04.871 --> 21:05.991
♪

21:06.081 --> 21:08.501
[whimpers]

21:12.541 --> 21:13.501
♪

21:13.581 --> 21:15.341
Lily, what's the matter?

21:16.711 --> 21:19.761
Could you please do me a favor
and stop pestering me?

21:19.841 --> 21:21.341
Go ahead and slay the dragon

21:21.421 --> 21:23.841
or whatever it is
you're trying to do.

21:23.931 --> 21:26.181
[REIN] But you and I are a team.

21:26.261 --> 21:27.761
If you're feeling worn out,

21:27.851 --> 21:29.811
we should catch a quick nap
or something.

21:29.891 --> 21:31.231
At first...

21:32.021 --> 21:33.561
I thought you were playing dumb.

21:34.311 --> 21:35.731
Turns out you don't have a clue

21:35.811 --> 21:37.401
what I was doing
these past two years.

21:37.481 --> 21:39.531
Nope, sure don't.

21:40.941 --> 21:44.411
[LILY] You wanna know
what I was really up to?

21:46.371 --> 21:49.041
I was doing absolutely nothing,
okay?

21:49.121 --> 21:52.461
Huh?
Uh, "nothing's" kinda broad.

21:53.081 --> 21:55.291
Even if you took a break,
so what?

21:55.381 --> 21:57.131
I mean you're still
the same Lily Flambert

21:57.211 --> 21:59.051
that defeated low-level dragons
at seven,

21:59.131 --> 22:00.671
tamed mid-level dragons at 12,

22:00.761 --> 22:02.971
and became the youngest S-rank
adventurer ever, aren't you?

22:03.051 --> 22:05.341
[screams]
You stupid, stupid, idiot!

22:05.431 --> 22:09.561
[shouts] Don't you ever
stop talking? Shut up, shut up!

22:10.931 --> 22:12.931
[♪ closing theme song playing]
